    "body": "## Scope: Chat03 post-merge repository memory reconciliation (documentation only)\n\n**Base:** `main@3f3455a713c446880daf7fde3341dbd8d6c4bedf`  \n**Head:** `1e2c83ac1568a5cd462fd03f3ef9f65084879d81`  \n**Five authorized files only:** `TASKS.md`, `PROJECT_MEMORY.md`, `.ai-memory/CURRENT.md`, `.ai-memory/CANON.md`, `.ai-memory/WORKFLOWS.md`.\n\n- Records exact normal merge sequence #440-446, final main SHA and verified exact-main 7/7 CI including local Worker/D1 0001-0007 and automatic Pages.\n- Distinguishes source integration from **unapproved hosted gameplay deployment, real-player identity, retention/keyring policy and Safari acceptance**. Sets next Chat03 gate to private-alpha policy and checkpoint/backup/recovery decisions.\n- Preserves all existing repository memory text beneath the newly marked current header, retaining historical file revisions and Stage 7.15 canon separately.\n- Labels live canonical Notion revision `2026-10-28-CHAT03-PR441-MERGED-PR442-DRAFT-BLOCKED-R199` as **stale for implementation status**, because attempted connector write was blocked. No Notion sync is claimed.\n- Notes issue #439 contains historical `NOT_IMPLEMENTED` and needs later status reconciliation. It must not authorize staging or any deployment.\n\n### Validation and safety\n\n- Compared HEAD to exact parent: **ahead 1 / behind 0**, exactly the five expected Markdown files (no src, tests, Worker, migrations, gameplay, policy or deployed mirrors).\n- One additive top-level checkpoint per file. Historical content preserved verbatim after header; no deletes of existing project history.\n- No Cloudflare, D1 migration, production operations, manual GitHub Pages publication, main write, force push, rebase or merges.\n- **Review required:** check wording and authoritative evidence before owner manually merges. This PR does not modify operational policy or authorize a release.\n\nEvidence: [final main commit](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/commit/3f3455a713c446880daf7fde3341dbd8d6c4bedf), [private local API #40659349212](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/actions/runs/40659349212), [CAS SQL #40659349376](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/actions/runs/40659349376), [Pages #40659348204](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/actions/runs/40659348204).",
